<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28286" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mēchănĭcus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηχανικός</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to mechanics,
				mechanical</i> (ante-class. and post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">disciplina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					10, 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">opera,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lampr. Alex. Sev. 2, 2</span></i>
			: ars, Firm. Math. 6, 31.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mēchănĭcus</span></b> ,
			i, m., <i>a mechanic</i>,
			Lucil. ap. Fest. s. v. petauristas, p. 206 Müll.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sipho, quem diabeten vocant mechanici,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					3, 10, 2</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Suet. Vesp.
			18</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mē-chănĭca</span></b> ,
			ae, f., <i>mechanics</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cyriades mechanicae professor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Symm. Ep. 10, 38</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mēchănĭca</span></b> ,
				ōrum, n., <i>works of mechanical art</i>, <i><span class="en">App. Mag.
				61, p. 314, 6</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
